# What every build of the game shares: HeliX, the game's sources, its entry point, and its shaders/*.glsl packed into assets/shaders
# when changed (helix.tool.Build). Each hxml is run from the game's directory, as haxe hxml/<file>.hxml; the paths in them are read
# from there.
-lib helix
-cp src
-main Main
--macro helix.tool.Build.packShaders()
